        </p>

        <h2>19. General</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>If a provision of these terms is held unenforceable, the rest continues in force.</li>
          <li>Our not enforcing a provision on one occasion does not waive our right to enforce it later.</li>
          <li>You may not assign these terms without our written consent. We may assign them as part of a merger, an acquisition or a sale of assets.</li>
          <li>These terms, together with the privacy pages referred to in section 5, are the entire agreement between you and us about the service.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>20. Contact and grievances</h2>
        <p>
          For questions about these terms, a data request, or a grievance under the Information
          Technology Act, 2000 and the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023, write to
          <a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`}>{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a>, addressed to the Grievance
          Officer, Yuktibyte Products Private Limited, Bengaluru, Karnataka, India. We aim to
          acknowledge a grievance within 24 hours and to resolve it within 15 days.
        </p>

      </div>

    </div>
